"view.eclipses.help"                           = "Enter a start date and an end date for the period for which you want to calculate eclipses. You can choose between Solar Eclipses, Lunar Eclipses or All Eclipses.\n\nYou can enter a location, but this is optional. Without a location, Enigma calculates the date, time and longitude of the eclipses in the period. If you do enter a location, you will see additional information about the eclipse.";
"view.eclipses.help.results"                   = "The results table has two variants. If you do not enter a location, you see the date and time of the eclipse and a symbol for the kind of eclipse: Solar Eclipse or Lunar Eclipse.\n\nIf you do enter a location, you also see the type of the eclipse: Total, Partial etc., an indication of visibility and the Saros number. If the eclipse is visible at the given location, you see a green checkmark; if the eclipse is not visible, a dash. If the eclipse is partially visible for part of the time, you see a circle with an X.";
